Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.49,0:00:03.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:07.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  摩妮卡怀孕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. Monica's gonna have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.28,0:00:10.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这能算是她的 "新经验" 吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, can this count as her "something new"?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.95,0:00:12.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:18.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你觉得这就是钱德逃婚的原因吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, do you think this is why Chandler took off?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.87,0:00:22.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是  她应该是刚刚才验的孕  我昨晚倒过垃圾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, she had to have just taken that test because I took out the trash last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这将会是有史以来最糟糕的一场婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh God, this is turning into the worst wedding day ever!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.84,0:00:30.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新娘怀孕  新郎逃婚  我还拿着这个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The bride's pregnant, the groom's missing and I'm still holding this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我们不能告诉任何人这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay Phoebe, we cannot tell anyone about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  没错  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right. Okay? Yeah. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.52,0:00:41.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  等一下  你知道  她用哪种方法避孕吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, wait. Do you know what kind of birth control she was uses?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.19,0:00:43.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.44,0:00:47.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将来会是个很好的广告啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just for the future. This is hardly a commercial for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.07,0:00:49.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第24集  摩妮卡和钱德的婚礼(下集)\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E24  The One With Chandler and Monica's Wedding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.16,0:00:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.37,0:00:55.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:00:58.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.29,0:01:00.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.29,0:01:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.59,0:01:04.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.34,0:01:10.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么消息吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.51,0:01:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  我跟在片场的乔伊谈过  他也没有他的消息\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. I talked to Joey on the set, He hasn't heard from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:16.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我又去问了钱德的父母\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I talked to Chandler's parents again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:18.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟她们说他失踪了  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You told them he was missing? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.19,0:01:21.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我装作打电话过去跟他们聊天\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I made it seemed like I was just calling to chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.56,0:01:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很确定她们两个  都以为我对她们有兴趣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pretty sure they both think I'm interested in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:27.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得告诉她他失踪了  不  不  我们不能那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, we've got to tell her he's gone. No, Hey! Hey! we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.61,0:01:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  她很快就会开始做准备了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, she's gonna start getting ready soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.07,0:01:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能拖延一下她吗  我会把昨晚找过的地方再找一遍\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, can't you at least stall her a little? I'll go back to some of the places I went last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.58,0:01:35.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,需要多少时间\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, well how much time do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她最晚要什么时候开始准备\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well how much time before she absolutely has to start getting ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.00,0:01:40.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顶多1个小时  给我两个小时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One hour. Give me two.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.75,0:01:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你干嘛问我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,祝我好运  我跟你一起去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, wish me luck. Okay. I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.92,0:01:48.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  你累了  你找了一夜了  很明显你不擅长找人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, you're tired. You've been looking all night. And clearly, you suck at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.18,0:01:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,待会见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'll see you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.39,0:01:57.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道该怎么拖延她吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Wait, do you know how you're gonna to stall her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:02:00.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会想出办法的  好吧  祝你好运\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll figure something out. Okay, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.27,0:02:06.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  我想我们得先开始化妆  然后再弄头发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Okay, so I thought we'd start with my makeup and then do my hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:10.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但你开始准备前  我想和你谈谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. But before you do that, I need you to talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谈什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.78,0:02:18.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远都没办法结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm never gonna getting married!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会的  你的真命天子快出现了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah you will. The right guy's just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.04,0:02:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们谈完了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, are we done with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我是认真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No Monica! I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.96,0:02:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也许我该忘了这些  当个女同性恋或什么的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, maybe I should just forget about it. Become a lesbian or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.43,0:02:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟你在一起的女人  真是个幸运儿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any woman would be lucky to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许我跟乔伊上床   会感觉好受一些\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well maybe it would make me feel better if I slept with Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.06,0:02:42.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  你没事吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel? You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.07,0:02:51.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  艾朗  我对计划通告表有点意见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Excuse me, Aaron? Hi! Umm, I have a little problem with the schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.28,0:02:56.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天本来没有我的戏   我必须要去参加一个婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Originally, I wasn't supposed to work today. and I have this wedding that I really have to be at.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.37,0:02:59.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我最好的朋友要结婚   我是证婚人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's my best friend's, and I'm officiating...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:01.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的四点后就得走\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I really can't work past 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:05.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  你得待到戏拍完  我们不能因为你一个而暂停拍戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, you've gotta stay until the end. We can't stop filming just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.09,0:03:08.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又不是你要结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not like it's your wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.05,0:03:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要动手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm having surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.26,0:03:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.76,0:03:17.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我骗你说我要结婚  因为我不希望你担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I-I just made up the stuff about the wedding, because I didn't want you to worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.10,0:03:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但其实今天我要动手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'm having surgery today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.43,0:03:22.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What kind of surgery?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,移植手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Transplant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.61,0:03:28.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你星期一都得拍戏的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you're supposed to work on Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:32.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,毛发移植手术\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hair transplant.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.49,0:03:34.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你不是秃头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you're not bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.74,0:03:36.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是在我头上移植\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not on my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.41,0:03:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的帮不上忙  或许你可以在四点前离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look Joey, there's nothing I can do. Besides, you'll probably gonna be out by 4 anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们只要拍一场戏  就你跟理查  他是专业的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We've got one short scene. It's just you and Richard, and God knows he's a pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.17,0:03:52.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没问题的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.80,0:03:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早安  理查\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Morning, Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.38,0:03:57.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来了  太棒了  我们开始吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, you're here. Great! Great! Great! Let's get going, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.94,0:03:59.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们继续拍戏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}we've got a scene to shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.89,0:04:04.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我系了两条皮带\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm wearing two belts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喝醉了吗  没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you drunk? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:11.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你喝醉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.36,0:04:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,算是吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.82,0:04:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来这就是你的办公室\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So this is your office?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.53,0:04:22.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们怎么找到我的  我真应该躲在健身房里的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How'd you guys find me? I knew I should've hid at the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.66,0:04:26.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在做什么啊   我在惊慌失措中\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the hell are you doing? Panicking.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:31.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,顺便上网找证据证明  我跟摩妮卡有血缘关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And using the Internet to try to prove that I'm related to Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:36.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她还好吗  她很好  她不知道你失踪了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How is she? She's fine. She doesn't know you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.30,0:04:39.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她也不必知道  走吧  我们回家了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she doesn't have to know. okay? Now come on, we're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.18,0:04:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不   我做不到  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No! I can't do that. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.77,0:04:45.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我回去  我们就会成为宾氏夫妇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because if I go home, we're gonna become the Bings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.19,0:04:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能当宾氏夫妇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't be the Bings.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.15,0:04:49.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宾氏夫妇有什么不对的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's wrong with being the Bings?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:51.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宾氏夫妇的婚姻很可怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The Bings have horrible marriages.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:54.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们会吵架  打成一团\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They yell, They fight, And they use the pool boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:57.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,还会把救生员  当成他们性爱游戏的玩物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...as a pawn in their sexual games.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:05:03.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你有没有穿上黑色晚礼服  要我到你饭店的房间吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, have you ever put on a black cocktail dress and asked me up to your hotel room?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.37,0:05:07.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有  那么你不是你父母\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Then you are neither of your parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:13.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不止是他们的婚姻  看看你的婚姻  看看大家的婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not just their marriage. I mean, look at yours. Look at everybody's.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.92,0:05:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有保罗纽曼的婚姻幸福美满\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The only person that can make marriage work is Paul Newman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.18,0:05:19.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很清楚我自己  我又不是保罗纽曼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I've met me; I am not Paul Newman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.30,0:05:24.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不会赛车或做爆米花  也不会捐钱给慈善团体\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't race cars, I don't make popcorn. None of my proceeds go to charity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But look Chandler...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.14,0:05:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在没有人比我更看不起你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...right now no one has a lower opinion of you than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我完全相信你做得到\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I totally believe you can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:40.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也想  我很爱她  但我害怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to. I love her so much, but I'm afraid--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这事太重要了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem. It's too huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:44.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  这是太重要了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, okay. You're right. It is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.83,0:05:48.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们为什么不一步一步慢慢来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So why don't we take it just a little bit at a time. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.58,0:05:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,暂时忘了结婚的事   忘了它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Umm, forget getting married for a sec. just forget about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:55.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你能回家洗个澡吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can you just come home and take a shower?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这没什么可怕的  是吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not scary, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.34,0:06:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那得看你说 "我们" 是什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Depends on what you mean by "we."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.97,0:06:05.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,漫漫长夜是最难熬的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The nights are the hardest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但天亮了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But then the day comes...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,白天就跟黑夜一样难熬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and that's every bit as hard as the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.32,0:06:18.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,然后黑夜又来了  白天跟黑夜都很难熬  我知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And then the night comes again... The days and nights are hard, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:22.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  我得开始准备了  今天我要结婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rachel I'm sorry! I have to start getting ready. I'm getting married today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.74,0:06:25.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  在黄昏的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. At dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.70,0:06:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说黄昏是很难熬的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's such a hard time for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:32.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要化妆了  我们得在一小时内赶到饭店  好的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm gonna go put my make up on, We have to be at the hotel in an hour! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:34.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等下  干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But wait! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.42,0:06:36.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们去吃午饭吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let's go to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:39.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能去吃午饭\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't go to lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.34,0:06:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:45.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我跌倒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, good God, I've fallen down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.97,0:06:49.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.60,0:06:52.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.48,0:06:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  听我说\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, honey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:06:59.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当我告诉你这件事时  我要你记得\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When I tell you what I'm about to tell you, I need you to remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.24,0:07:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都会支持你  我们都爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that we're all here for you, and that we love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.99,0:07:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  你真的吓坏我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, you're-you're really freaking me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.20,0:07:10.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找不到钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can't find Chandler--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:13.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,的背心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'s vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找不到钱德的背心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We can't find Chandler's vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.54,0:07:18.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能  等一下  你是认真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How can that be? Oh wait! Wait, Are you, are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.97,0:07:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,背心找到了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Found the vest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.34,0:07:25.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得看好它  不能再弄丢了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean we're gonna have to keep an eye on it, y'know make sure we don't lose it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.47,0:07:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  别那样吓我  好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wow. Okay, don't scare me like that, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.39,0:07:35.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚我还想说  "天啊  最糟糕的事发生了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean for a minute, there I was like, "Oh, my God. The worst has happened."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们两个结过婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you two were married, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.96,0:07:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,后来发生了什么事  你们就慢慢疏远了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What happened, you just drift apart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:08:00.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,新娘来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Here comes the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.05,0:08:06.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.93,0:08:09.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想每天都穿这件婚纱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want to wear this every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.72,0:08:11.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的好漂亮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look so beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我都为自己感到高兴\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so happy for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.90,0:08:21.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喂  嘿  找到钱德了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hello? Hey! Did Chandler show up yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.65,0:08:25.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们找到他了  没事了  该死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, we got him back. Everything's fine. Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.86,0:08:28.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了  你在哪里  我还在片场\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Why? Where are you? I'm still on the set.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.62,0:08:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  不到一小时婚礼就要开始了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey! The wedding is in less than an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.91,0:08:36.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  对不起  跟我对戏的演员喝醉了  戏没拍好他们不让我离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know! I'm sorry. The guy's drunk. They won't let me go until we get this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  我得再去找位牧师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. I'm gonna have to find another minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.71,0:08:43.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  我就是牧师\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! No, I'm the minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.59,0:08:47.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  叫他们两个一起来听电话  我现在就帮他们证婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, look-look, Put them both on the phone and I'll marry them right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.93,0:08:49.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我得挂电话了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh! Joey, I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  别挂我电话啊  我现在就可以证婚  我有权力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Don't hang up on me. I'll marry you and me right now. I have the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.35,0:09:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看看  你现在穿上了礼服\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There you go. You put on a tuxedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.27,0:09:03.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一点都不可怕吧  对不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now that wasn't so scary, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.90,0:09:05.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.95,0:09:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你说   要一步一步慢慢来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm telling you, just a little bit at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.49,0:09:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  接下来我们做什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah okay. Well, what's the next little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.49,0:09:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结婚啊  好  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Getting married. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.70,0:09:19.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定也能做好  就像其它你做好过的事一样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can, you can do that too. Just like you've done everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:25.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对  我可以做好  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you're right. I can do that. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.55,0:09:29.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要出去下  你要去哪里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, excuse me for a minute. Wh—Hey—Whoa-whoa, where, where you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.59,0:09:33.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  我不会再逃跑了  我只想呼吸点新鲜空气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross, I'm not gonna run away again! I just want to get a little fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.72,0:09:35.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}okay. okay
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.28,0:09:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  新鲜空气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, fresh air.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等  或许你反应过度了  你常这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait! Maybe, maybe you're overreacting! You do that y'know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.03,0:09:54.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  菲比  我们得想个办法\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well Phoebe, We gotta do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.04,0:09:59.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊没办法准时赶过来  我会看看  饭店里有没有其他人在办婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, y'know. I mean there's no way Joey's gonna make it in time. So I'm gonna through the hotel and see if there's any other weddings going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:04.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别告诉他们摩妮卡怀孕了  因为他们厌恶那种事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Oh but don't tell them Monica's pregnant, because they frown on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.50,0:10:05.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.06,0:10:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"安纳斯塔赛奇斯  巴巴西法奇斯联姻"  太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Anastassakis Papasifakis wedding." Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.56,0:10:25.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.73,0:10:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mazel tov.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.90,0:10:29.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  漂亮的帽子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Oh, great hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我想要你帮我另一场婚礼证婚  可以吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Listen umm, I need you to perform another wedding. Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.20,0:10:38.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  他们是希腊正教的信徒吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know. Are they Greek Orthodox?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.33,0:10:39.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  是的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.16,0:10:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我的朋友  摩妮卡史蒂芬诺波里斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They're…they're-they're my friends, Monica Stephanopolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.92,0:10:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟钱德艾西多菲利斯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Chandler Acidophilus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:56.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.81,0:10:59.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.14,0:11:04.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有人看到钱德了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Has umm, anyone seen Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.31,0:11:07.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还以为他跟你在一起  他刚才是跟我在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought he was with you. He-he was with me umm,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:10.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在玩游戏  捉迷藏\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're playing a little game. y'know? Hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.49,0:11:13.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不能问我们  儿子  你那是作弊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You can't ask us, son. That's cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:21.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,说得对  谢谢你纠正我  爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're right. Thanks for keeping me honest, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.08,0:11:25.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他最好别到这里来  他不能看到新娘穿婚纱的样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, he better not come by here. He can't see the bride in her wedding dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:30.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还记得我们结婚的时候  我看到新郎穿婚纱的样子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As I recall when we got married, I saw the groom in the wedding dress.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.34,0:11:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是婚礼后的事  那样就不会带来恶运了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But that was after the wedding. It's not bad luck then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.93,0:11:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  那样也没带来好运啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, it isn't good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:44.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.77,0:11:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.57,0:11:50.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德还好吗  他好极了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, how's Chandler doing? Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他非常好  别担心钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's doing great. Don't you worry about Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.57,0:12:00.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我能跟你谈下吗  没问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, can I see you for a second? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.50,0:12:07.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么事  钱德又不见了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's going on? Chandler's gone again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.13,0:12:13.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  为什么要跟一个可能会逃跑的人玩捉迷藏呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh my God! Why would you play hide-and-seek with someone you know is a flight risk?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.51,0:12:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,艾朗  你得放我走  那家伙烂醉如泥\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aaron, you gotta let me go. The guy's hammered.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.27,0:12:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  只要他还清醒地待在这里  我们就得继续拍下去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry Joey, As long as he's here and he's conscious, we're still shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:39.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有根大号的叉子啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You wouldn't happen to have a very big fork?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.91,0:12:43.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚跟导演谈过了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I uh, I just talked to the director.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样  今天就拍到这里了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's it. We're done for the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.63,0:12:49.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的戏拍完了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well have we finished the scene?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:54.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你表现的很棒  你也是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. You were wonderful. As were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.97,0:12:57.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我把你的车开过来了  车子就停在外面\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I got your car. It's right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.30,0:12:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢   别客气\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.64,0:13:04.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  我们得走了  来吧  要走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No-no-no! we gotta go. Come on. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.14,0:13:08.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的屁股吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that my ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.53,0:13:17.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他在那里  干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There he is! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.20,0:13:19.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.16,0:13:22.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这次你逃不了  先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're not getting away this time mister!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.45,0:13:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你真的要我痛扁你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless you want that ass-kicking we talked about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.83,0:13:29.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗斯  嘿呀\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ross. Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.21,0:13:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是认真的  你别想抛弃我妹妹\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm serious. You're not walking out on my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.09,0:13:36.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  我不会的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right. I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.05,0:13:40.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那你跑到哪里去了  我知道摩妮卡的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then where the hell have you been? I know about Monica.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.80,0:13:43.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道了  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.06,0:13:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我听到你跟瑞秋说话  什么  什么  说了什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I heard you and Rachel talking. What?! What?! Talking about what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.89,0:13:52.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道什么  如果你们不立刻告诉我发生了什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Know what—If somebody doesn't tell me what's going on right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.48,0:13:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛  你会"嘿呀"吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What, you'll "hi-yah"?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.32,0:13:58.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩妮卡怀孕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.99,0:14:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:05.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  你没有被吓跑吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. And you're not freaking out?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.91,0:14:09.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是吓坏了  后来我去了礼品店买香烟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well I was. Then I went down to the gift shop because cigarettes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.08,0:14:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,香烟  请谈正事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Cigarettes? Big picture, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我在礼品店看到这个东西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I was in the gift shop, that's when I saw this...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.01,0:14:25.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我想  能穿上这玩意的东西  应该不可怕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, y'know what? And I thought anything that can fit into this can't be scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:29.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很明显地  你没看过《灵异入侵少年军团3》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well you obviously didn't see Chuckie III.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.14,0:14:33.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别这样  看看这件小衣服有多可爱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But come on, look at how cute and small this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:38.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要把它送给摩妮卡  她会知道我没事的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I got it to give Monica, so she'd know I was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.74,0:14:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,做得好  儿子  我就知道你一定能找到他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Way to go, son. I knew you'd find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:55.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的小儿子要结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Our little boy is getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.59,0:14:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你  真的好英俊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh Look at you, so handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:15:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来很漂亮  妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look beautiful, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.93,0:15:06.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来也很漂亮  爸\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look beautiful too, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:11.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很高兴你们都来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm so glad you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.11,0:15:22.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是钱德吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.40,0:15:24.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是乔伊吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you Joey?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:32.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这真的是太棒了  什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Huh. This is nice. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:37.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我第一次走在红毯上  知道自己不可能会离婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've never walked down the aisle knowing it can't end in divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.81,0:15:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真希望你祖母能活着看到这一幕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh I wish your grandmother had lived to see this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:16:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但奶奶就在那边啊  不是那个老太婆  我是说我妈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's right there. Not that old crone. My mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.36,0:16:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你  亲爱的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Congratulations, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:08.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们爱你  甜心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We love you, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.00,0:16:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来好美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You look beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.79,0:16:18.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是新买的吗  不要现在讨论\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is this new? Not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.71,0:16:25.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁  我是卡扛巴索斯神父\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who's this? I'm Father Karabasos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.43,0:16:27.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是希腊正教的神父\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's Greek Orthodox.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.43,0:16:29.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们也是希腊正教的信徒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}As are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:33.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,开始举行婚礼吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let us begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:36.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的来宾\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dearly beloved--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.23,0:16:38.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是我的台词\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's my line.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.99,0:16:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从这里开始接手  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can take it from here. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.61,0:16:51.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的来宾  抱歉我来迟了一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dearly beloved, I'm sorry I'm a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你们会觉得很困惑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You may be confused by this now...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:17:01.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但到了2002年阵亡将士纪念日  你们就会了解了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but you won't be Memorial Day weekend, 2002.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.92,0:17:07.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快点开始婚礼吧   免得新郎又逃跑了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, let's get started before the groom takes off again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.02,0:17:16.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们齐聚在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are gathered here today...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.77,0:17:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,参加这个男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to join this man...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.48,0:17:23.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟这个女人神圣的婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and this woman in the bonds of holy matrimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.69,0:17:28.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟摩妮卡及钱德认识很久了  我不能想像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've known Monica and Chandler for a long time, and I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.16,0:17:33.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有谁会比他们两个更般配\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...imagine two people more perfect for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:41.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我把演讲稿  忘在更衣室里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now, as I've left my notes in my dressing room...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.13,0:17:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我们直接念誓词吧  摩妮卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...we shall proceed to the vows. Monica?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:50.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他逃跑了  快点  快点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He took off? Go on. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.52,0:17:59.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  从小\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, for so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.94,0:18:03.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就在想  我能不能找到我的白马王子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I wondered if I would ever find my prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.94,0:18:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的灵魂伴侣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My soul mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.07,0:18:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三年前  在另一场婚礼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then three years ago, at another wedding...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.15,0:18:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我向朋友寻求安慰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I turned to a friend for comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.99,0:18:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,结果我找到了  我一直在找的一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And instead, I found everything that I'd been looking for my whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.00,0:18:21.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.92,0:18:24.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...here we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:28.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一起迎接未来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with our future before us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.34,0:18:32.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只想跟你在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I only want to spend it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.39,0:18:37.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的白马王子   我的灵魂伴侣\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My prince. My soul mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:39.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.56,0:18:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,除非你不愿意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Unless you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.36,0:18:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,轮到你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.36,0:18:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.57,0:18:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  没关系\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.04,0:19:03.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩尼卡  我以为这会是我做的最艰难的一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Monica I thought this was going to be the most difficult thing I ever had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.09,0:19:09.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我看到你走过红毯时  我了解到它真的很简单\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But when I saw you walking down that aisle, I realized how simple it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.22,0:19:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.43,0:19:20.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不论出现什么样的惊喜  没关系  因为我会永远爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Any surprises that come our way, it's okay, because I will always love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.85,0:19:27.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我注定要跟你共度余生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You are the person I was meant to spend the rest of my life with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:29.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道我确不确定吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You want to know if I'm sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.11,0:19:36.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以吻新娘了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You may now kiss the bride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:39.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.75,0:19:43.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要以纽约州跟网友们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess by the powers vested in me by the State of New York...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.75,0:19:46.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,赋给我的权力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and the Internet guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:52.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我现在宣布你们已结为夫妇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I now pronounce you husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.97,0:19:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  你们愿意吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, wait. Do you take each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.01,0:19:58.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我愿意  我愿意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do. I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.51,0:20:00.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  你们都愿意\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,戒指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rings?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.89,0:20:04.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  该死  好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, crap. Okay—uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:08.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来戴婚戒吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}uh let's-let's do the rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.41,0:20:21.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以吗  可以  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We good? Yeah? Good?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.21,0:20:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要再一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Once again...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.17,0:20:28.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,宣布你们结为夫妇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I pronounce you husband and wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.96,0:20:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以再吻新娘一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now kiss her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.31,0:20:48.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.27,0:20:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道宝宝的事了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I know about the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.27,0:20:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么宝宝  我们的宝宝\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What baby? Our baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.53,0:20:55.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有宝宝了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We have a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.86,0:20:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比发现了你的验孕棒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe found your pregnancy test in the trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.49,0:21:01.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有验孕\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't take a pregnancy test.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.87,0:21:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那么是谁验了孕呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then who did?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.45,0:21:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看他们\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.25,0:21:10.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且他们要有孩子了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And they're gonna have a baby.
